title: "Myoelectric Signal Processing"
abstract: >-
  Filtering, onset detection, and a time and frequency domain feature library
  for surface electromyography, where every stage states the delay it spends
  so a chain from amplifier to prosthesis controller can be costed against the
  100 to 125 ms a user tolerates.
